          "snippet": {
            "text": "/-- **Cauchy-Schwarz inequality** for finsets using square roots in `ℝ`. -/\nlemma sum_mul_le_sqrt_mul_sqrt (s : Finset ι) (f g : ι → ℝ) :\n    ∑ i ∈ s, f i * g i ≤ √(∑ i ∈ s, f i ^ 2) * √(∑ i ∈ s, g i ^ 2) :=\n  (le_sqrt_of_sq_le <| sum_mul_sq_le_sq_mul_sq _ _ _).trans_eq <| sqrt_mul\n    (sum_nonneg fun _ _ ↦ by positivity) _",
            "line": 498,
            "truncated": false
          },
          "proof_context": {
            "declaration": "Real.sum_mul_le_sqrt_mul_sqrt",
            "lines": [
              498,
              502
            ],
            "conclusion": "For real `f, g` on a finset, `∑ f i g i ≤ √(∑ f i²) √(∑ g i²)`."
